      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OVER THE LINE (6) ran second last start at Swan Hill over 2240m, beaten 3.5 metres. Has the talent to take care of this field. FLEUR BELLA (1) settled in the leading division then took over the lead and maintained the advantage to take out a 2190m race at Mildura last start, adding to her fine third the run prior at Mildura. Sure to enjoy an economical run from this draw. Her last-start form is good enough to take out a race like this. HAVADASH JOH (2) finished fourth two runs ago then broke and finished a distant last over 2190m at Maryborough at the latest appearance. Sure to enjoy an economical run from this draw. Meets a similar line up so if he behaves a big run is likely. TEX GOES BANG (4) must be respected after scoring last start by 1.5 metres at Shepparton over 2190m.",
